    "finding": "Recall at analyst review moves from 0.42 to 0.69 while wrong settlement holds stay at 0. The graph carries the funnel archetype specifically: ring recall goes 0.43 -> 1.00, because a funnel member is unremarkable alone by construction and nothing about the merchant itself will ever select it.",
    "voice_note": "Voice does not move recall and is not measured on that axis. It is only placed on merchants already heading for action, so by construction it cannot surface a new case. What it changes is corroboration: merchants with two or more independent dissenting views go from 28 to 29. That is the axis a verification call belongs on."
  },
